[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The table is intentionally empty of rejection rows: `rev16` is a pure, total
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m function over `uint32_t`. There is no input it rejects, no code path that can
