[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Generic boundary rows tested anyway (Phase C)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
