[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    49[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `tests/differential.rs` (`phase_c_*` tests). Each asserts C and Rust return the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **same 32-bit value**, and that neither aborts.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
