[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 1 | `rev16` | high half = 0, low half = 0 (empty; minimum input) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    56[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 2 | `rev16` | high half = 0, low half = `0xFFFF` (all-ones, saturated) | [x] |
