[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    58[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 4 | `rev16` | high half = 0, low half = exactly two bits set, all 120 pairs (cardinality "many", minimal) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 5 | `rev16` | high half = 0, low half = uniformly random 16-bit values (cardinality "many", 20 000 samples) | [x] |
