[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    62[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 8 | `rev16` | high half = 0, low half = nibble-shape inputs: `0x000X`,`0x00X0`,`0x0X00`,`0xX000` for all 16 `X` (nibble axis of stage 3) | [x] |
