[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    65[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 11 | `rev16` | high half = `0xFFFF` (all-ones discarded half) × low half random (20 000 samples) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    66[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 12 | `rev16` | high half = uniformly random × low half = 0 (only discarded bits vary; result must stay `0`) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    67[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 13 | `rev16` | high half = uniformly random × low half = uniformly random — full 32-bit random sweep (50 000 samples) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    68[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 14 | `rev16` | whole-word boundary interpretations: `0x0000_0000`, `0x0000_0001`, `0x0000_FFFF`, `0x0001_0000`, `0x7FFF_FFFF`, `0x8000_0000`, `0x8000_0001`, `0xFFFF_0000`, `0xFFFF_FFFF` | [x] |
